{
  "name": "sgbhsd-price-share",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "三国冰河时代富甲天下跑商价格分享：城池/商品买卖价格录入、查询与共享 (Node.js + SQLite + Vue3 + Element Plus)",
  "main": "server/index.js",
